# ACG gallery shotlist, 2026-11-07 (write-shotlist, director pass by an Opus sub-agent; scenarios written, drift check pending the first run).
#
# MOD: a serum bench (ACG_SerumBench) turns a genepack into a serum (ACG_AnimalTraitSerum); a colonist applies it to an ordinary animal through the
# float menu; the animal gets an Animal Traits System trait that recolours its coat (241 colour tints) or draws a marking (chest patch, Kuru only).
# The mod adds no animal. NSB animals with a mod effect: Kuru only (chest patch is his canon, KURU-PROFIL.md). Shogun, Atticus, Rain keep their coat.
#
# STORY: one clear day at the Sanctuary. Nelim, researcher outfit all day (LisaWork_ApparelShirtButtoned rgb (222, 203, 164), LisaWork_ApparelSkirt
# rgb (31, 58, 95), LisaWork_ApparelHornRimmedGlasses, Apparel_PAESmallEarrings, hair Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony, her own face with MouthLipsSmirk as her
# smile, no sweat, map at 20 degrees), gives colour to the animals. Morning: she makes a serum at the bench. Then she gives Kuru his white chest
# patch, stands with a blue labrador beside Shogun, treats a horse in the barn, and walks home at dusk with her dogs. Clear weather; one
# `I set the hour to N` per image, 2,500 ticks per game hour.
#
# SHOTS (index, place, hour, type)
#   1. bench-1-dawn   preindustrial-workshop 7h (centre 223, 237) wide-medium, opening. ACG_SerumBench at (222, 236), genepack at (222, 235), Nelim, after the DoBill
#                     job (300 ticks, then she is put at (222, 237) north of the bench facing south, toward the camera, smiling, the vial lying on the bench cell (222, 236); run 4e81 showed her back). Shogun stands at (221, 237) facing east toward her in his own collar from the save.
#                     GeneBank near (225, 238), TorchLamp at (221, 239) and (226, 239) lit, Stool, PlantPot with Plant_Daylily
#                     at (227, 238), SculptureSmall. The workshop is emptied first (power cells and a dining set stood on the cells of runs 03ec, 0c94, e318). Root size 3.2 at (222, 237) (3.5 in run b051 left a bare tiled floor with the decor far out, 2.5 in run 06f3 hid the decor off frame; decor now within 3 cells) so the bench reads at 268 px. Subtitle: "The serum is ready at the bench."
#                     Instant: the vial has just come out, she looks up at the camera with it before the pick-up. Foreground the genepack and the bench edge, background the torches and the GeneBank, Nelim at the centre facing the camera, Shogun and the torches around her, warm torch light against the dawn.
#   2. kuru-2-patch   hut 9h (centre 144, 73) close, root size 3 (run 27cc at 5.5 gave about 98 px per cell, Kuru 55 px tall: px per cell is about 1080 / (2 x root size), so 3 gives about 180 px per cell and Kuru about 110 px, NPT 2026-11-08; the framing step lifts the game floor of 11 by itself, SimpleCameraSetting not needed; second lantern and stool added). Just after the apply: Nelim at (143, 73) facing east, serum used, Kuru
#                     (akaNEKO_kuroneko) at (144, 73) facing south with AnimalTrait_ChestPatch (white patch on black fur). DR_StickLantern lit near (141, 74), Shelf near (139, 74), SculptureSmall near (146, 71), Stool near (141, 72) (run 5fa2 showed a bare wooden floor).
#                     Subtitle: "Kuru gets his white chest patch."
#                     Instant: the serum has just gone in, Kuru has not moved yet. Foreground Kuru and the patch, background the lit lantern and the tatami, Nelim off-centre right, soft morning light.
#   3. labradors-3-coats flower-garden 11h (centre 154, 110) medium, root size 5. Shogun at (154, 110) and an anonymous labrador "Lab1" at (156, 110) with
#                     AnimalTrait_Skin_PaleRed (tints multiply the coat: blue on yellow read grey in runs 5ea8 and be78), both facing south toward the camera. Nelim at (150, 109) walks to (148, 109), paused mid-stride. Plant_Daylily
#                     at (151, 108) and (157, 108), DR_StickLantern at (150, 112) lit (the flower pot is dropped: its rim under the plant read as a smiley in run 54eb). Subtitle: "Same breed, two coats."
#                     Instant: Nelim has just walked off after the tint, the two dogs hold their pose. Foreground the two labradors, background the daylilies and the lantern, dogs off-centre, midday light.
#   4. horse-4-serum   barn 14h (centre 197, 237) medium, root size 3 (run gallery-s: hay field bare, decoration 3.5; two stools, shelf, sculpture, two daylilies added), Nelim re-placed at (195, 237), more Hay at (195, 240) (198, 235) (195, 234) (200, 241), TorchLamp near (192, 239) and (202, 238) (run 9852 at root size 4 cut the alpaca and lanterns off). Nelim at (193, 237) walks to the horse "Mare1" at (198, 237) holding the serum (gene
#                     Skin_Orange), the apply not yet done after 120 ticks. Alpaca "Alpa1" at (197, 235) south of the horse (run gallery-t: at 239 it sat at the top, background) with AnimalTrait_Skin_Purple in the foreground (run 54eb: cut off at the top, a cow and a piglet at the west edge: frame moved east, root size 4). Hay at (194, 239),
#                     DR_StickLantern at (194, 235) and (200, 235) lit, two more Hay at (196, 236) and (199, 239). Subtitle: "Next in line: the barn horse."
#                     Instant: Nelim has picked up the serum and crosses the last cells to the horse. Foreground the purple alpaca, background the lit lanterns and the hay, afternoon light in the barn.
#   5. bridge-5-dusk   river-bridge 17h (centre 135, 124) wide, closing, root size 4. Nelim walks from (137, 124) to (131, 124), Shogun at (133, 125) and
#                     the red-coat labrador "Lab2" (AnimalTrait_Skin_PaleRed) follow, alpaca "Alpa2" grazes at (130, 127) (run 54eb: cut off at the corner) with AnimalTrait_Skin_Purple (the brown horse showed no tint), DR_StickLantern
#                     at (132, 126) lit. Subtitle: "Home at dusk, with a few new colours."
#                     Instant: the walk home has just begun over the bridge. Foreground the blue labrador and Shogun, background the grazing horse and the lit lantern, low golden light from the west.
#   6. genepack-window interface window (not rated), window-backdrop-for-height, cropped, no subtitle: genepack at (90, 140), ITab_Genes, "Chest patch".
# Mods for the -DepMap: wsl-deps.acg-gallery.map (NSB wsl-deps.sanctuary-nelim.map + luved.animaltraits + akairo.LetsHaveaCat + Mlie.StickLantern 2024351846).
# Director remarks kept: vial close cut, Kuru shot is the close shot, Tama dropped, mid-action instants, unnatural tints, no brazier or bed in the barn,
# Kuru dropped from the bridge. Not taken: asking validation for Kuru (his chest patch is NSB canon, rule 3 covers colonist properties only).
# Cells: place centres of SanctuarySteps.cs; decor goes through "near" so the game picks a legal cell; a bad pawn cell fails the first run and is fixed then.
